  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\ndef solve():\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=sorted(map(int,input().split()),reverse=True)\r\n    pr=[0]\r\n    for x in a:\r\n        pr.append(pr[-1]+x)\r\n    answer=0\r\n    for first in range(n+1):\r\n        limit=n-first\r\n        low,high=0,limit\r\n        while low<high:\r\n            mid=(low+high)//2\r\n            p=first+2*mid\r\n            q=3*n-2*first-mid\r\n            change=a[p]+a[p+1]-3*a[q-1]\r\n            if change>=0:\r\n                low=mid+1 \r\n            else:\r\n                high=mid \r\n        second=low\r\n        p=first+2*second\r\n        q=3*n-2*first-second\r\n        curr=(2*pr[first]+pr[p]+3*pr[q])\r\n        answer=max(answer,curr)\r\n    print(answer)\r\nk=int(input())\r\nfor i in range(k):\r\n    solve()",
